From: Wine upstream contributors (see commit list)
Subject: [PATCH] Carry WineHQ fixes in ntdll, win32u and server.

Forty WineHQ commits from wine-11.1 to master after wine-11.20, applied
unchanged in upstream order; test-only hunks are omitted. They make
ntdll, win32u and wineserver behave as Windows does in cases games,
launchers and installers reach: time zones and timers, locale data,
file and volume queries, process memory reads, system threads, bitmap
alpha, glyph outlines, window class and atom handling, window surfaces
and drag and drop. None changes the wineserver protocol, a unix-call
table or a structure shared between modules, and none touches code
CrossOver changed (maintainer decision 2026-10-26). See
docs/upstream-reviews.md, "ntdll, win32u and server fixes".

  8c1dcfc77d (wine-11.1, Paul Gofman): ntdll: Don't fill output handle on error in LdrLoadDll().
  5aa9e20efe (wine-11.3, Zhiyi Zhang): win32u: Ignore alpha channels for 32-bit DIB bitmaps.
  9ad182656c (wine-11.3, Rémi Bernon): win32u: Don't offset client rect when using D3D present rect.
  dab7d8deda (wine-11.3, Elizabeth Figura): ntdll: Initialize the entire FileId in FileIdExtdBothDirectoryInformation.
  5f881b67ea (wine-11.3, Elizabeth Figura): ntdll: Initialize LockingTransactionId in FileIdGlobalTxDirectoryInformation.
  f6c53a242a (wine-11.4, Piotr Caban): ntdll: Fix threadpool timer behavior on system time change.
  9c027fac91 (wine-11.4, Paul Gofman): server: FIx timezone bias for timezones defined with inverse DST on Unix.
  bfae6eb8b4 (wine-11.4, Paul Gofman): ntdll: Fix get_timezone_info() for timezones defined with inverse DST on Unix.
  da3b638c85 (wine-11.5, Paul Gofman): win32u: Set VendorId / DeviceId in DirectX registry key with correct size.
  27aad48fa8 (wine-11.6, Yongjie Yao): win32u: Fixed thread safety issues with NtUserRegistClassExWOW and NtUserUnregisterClass.
  c69173c460 (wine-11.6, Paul Gofman): server: Do not return STATUS_ACCESS_DENIED from read_process_memory_vm() for zero read.
  1ebcc3fb9b (wine-11.7, Jinoh Kang): ntdll: Do not fail with STATUS_INVALID_INFO_CLASS for anonymous files.
  720ea07775 (wine-11.9, Alexandre Julliard): server: Don't allow accessing the context of system threads.
  ca175f340c (wine-11.9, Alexandre Julliard): server: Don't send debug events for system threads.
  b1a9794b14 (wine-11.11, Rémi Bernon): user32: Set builtin class FNID for menu controls.
  66a1d04995 (wine-11.11, Kellen Kopp): win32u: Fixed incorrect glyph outline size.
  4d6a6cd036 (wine-11.11, Paul Gofman): win32u: Always consider newly created shape updated in set_surface_shape().
  e45f9ad9bd (wine-11.11, Zhengyong Chen): win32u: Fix signed coordinate extraction in drag_drop_call.
  65a3d0cf1c (wine-11.12, Etaash Mathamsetty): win32u: Always flush the window surface in expose_window_surface.
  5f47658c5c (wine-11.12, Alexandre Julliard): ntdll: Initialize fiber data to 0x1e00.
  93939c0659 (wine-11.12, Alexandre Julliard): server: Fix returned status for NtUnlockFile on unlocked range.
  51f87a11a1 (wine-11.12, Zhiyi Zhang): server: Fix a memory leak in d3dkmt_share_objects.
  c403790475 (wine-11.14, Rose Hellsing): ntdll: Return empty value instead of failing in NtQueryVolumeInformation.
  e8781e7c8d (wine-11.14, Elizabeth Figura): ntdll: Handle Unix paths with no corresponding drive in get_full_path().
  864ca426a3 (wine-11.14, Bernhard Übelacker): server: Clear connection failure events in IOCTL_AFD_WINE_CONNECT.
  5bb70f23d1 (wine-11.14, Piotr Caban): server: Set kernel notification events initial state.
  730d06d7b7 (wine-11.16, Rémi Bernon): server: Check DPI awareness contexts when reparenting windows.
  b4622e972d (wine-11.16, Matteo Bruni): win32u: Fix get_locale_data() table entry lookup.
  63f8091369 (wine-11.17, Nikolay Sivov): server: Fix freeing unlinked windows.
  2ecc2f84b4 (wine-11.17, Evan Morse): ntdll: Return the object manager status from NtQueryFullAttributesFile.
  32324bf1ef (wine-11.17, Alexandre Julliard): ntdll: Return the default user UI language for LOCALE_CUSTOM_UI_DEFAULT.
  0405e200e2 (wine-11.17, Rémi Bernon): win32u: Fix some truncated query_renderer_integer memcpy.
  3e132b3cbb (wine-11.17, Rémi Bernon): win32u: Avoid possible buffer overflow in NtUserGetAtomName.
  1fe3600b16 (wine-11.18, Alistair Leslie-Hughes): server: Correct sizeof usage.
  79e718d7bf (wine-11.18, Zhiyi Zhang): win32u: Set a clip region when handling WM_PRINT PRF_CHILDREN.
  336df56a67 (wine-11.19, Eric Blum): win32u: Fix minimum width of WS_EX_TOOLWINDOW windows.
  fc5dd34cc3 (wine-11.19, Alex Henrie): ntdll: Set IPV6_MTU_DISCOVER for IPv6, not IPv4, in sock_ioctl.
  bf98c93e00 (wine-11.19, Alistair Leslie-Hughes): server: Correct mode mask compare.
  1c4cb6c6bf (wine-11.20, Etaash Mathamsetty): win32u: Don't return early if no monitor id is present.
  06c0cb5c5e (master after wine-11.20, Paul Gofman): ntdll: Ignore semaphore errors in RtlpUnWaitCriticalSection().

